direction right

New batch [shape: oval, icon: upload]
Encoder [icon: cpu, label: "SigLIP encoder (frozen, cached)"]
pHash [icon: hash]
Duplicate cascade [icon: copy]
Label QA [icon: check-square, label: "Cluster label QA"]
Drift test [icon: activity, label: "Classifier two-sample test"]
Active labeling [icon: target, label: "Uncertainty + diversity selection"]
Labelers [shape: oval, icon: users]
Training set [shape: cylinder, icon: database]

New batch > pHash > Duplicate cascade
New batch > Encoder > Duplicate cascade
Encoder > Label QA
Encoder > Drift test
Encoder > Active labeling > Labelers > Training set
Duplicate cascade > Training set: drop duplicates
Label QA > Labelers: suspects to review
